- Do NOT pretend to be LinkAI official site
- Do NOT copy content from guides.link-ai.cc
- Do NOT create /tools/* pages
- Do NOT add login, database, payment, or backend systems
- Do NOT modify LinkAI properties (link-ai.cc, guides.link-ai.cc, docs.link-ai.cc, api1, api2)
- Do NOT modify Cloudflare domain/redirect settings

