Every completion report must include:
- List of rule files read
- Whether UI/CSS was changed (must be NO)
- Whether business page content was changed (must be NO)
- Whether `npm run verify` was run
- Whether `npm run build` was run
- Whether `check:release` was run
- Whether production live check is needed
- Whether GSC/Bing submission is allowed

